  "rationale": "We deny the claim because the claimant intentionally caused the collision by deliberately steering into a concrete barrier, which means the loss was not accidental. Policy clause PLUS-2.1 governs this decision by specifying that coverage applies only to direct and accidental loss. The key fact is the claimant's own account stating they steered their car into the barrier on purpose.",
